---
title: Desktop boot order, with failure paths (implemented)
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Main as main (devworks-desktop)
  participant Eng as Engine thread (Tokio current-thread)
  participant Store as SqliteStore
  participant Boot as devworks_engine::boot
  participant Disp as Dispatcher
  participant Art as ArtifactService
  participant HK as Housekeeper
  participant Shell as Shell (egui)
  Main->>Eng: Engine::start(DesktopConfig)
  Eng->>Store: SqliteStore::open (data-root lock, schema gate, migrations, record boot)
  alt another process owns the data root / incompatible schema / I/O
    Store-->>Eng: StorageError (DataRootInUse, IncompatibleSchema, Io)
    Eng-->>Main: StartError::Store
    Main->>Shell: ShellInit { backend: Err(reason) }
    Note over Shell: every route shows the designed Offline state, nothing is admitted
  else opened
    Eng->>Boot: boot(Composition) — one store, core ports, required consumers
    Boot->>Disp: 1. compose with reply_consumer + caller consumers
    alt duplicate or reserved consumer name, bad bounds
      Boot-->>Eng: BootError::Composition
    end
    Boot->>Disp: 2. recover(): classify Preflighted→RetryPending, Dispatching→OutcomeUnknown, requeue / hold / cancel prior-boot claims
    alt recovery fails
      Boot-->>Eng: BootError::Queue
    end
    Boot->>Art: 3. recover(): finish or fail staging, remove staged and orphaned generations
    alt
      Boot-->>Eng: BootError::Artifacts
    end
    Boot->>HK: 4. boot(machine resources): reconcile owned trees by pid + birth token, then leases
    alt
      Boot-->>Eng: BootError::Resources
    end
    Boot->>Boot: 5. apply keep-awake from power.keepAwake (BootError::Settings when unreadable)
    Boot->>Disp: 6. run() — delivery starts
    Boot->>Art: 7. collection pass now, then periodic, housekeeping ticks
    Boot-->>Eng: 8. Runtime (the only admission handle)
    Eng->>Store: register local-user as Human principal (host bookkeeping, after recovery)
    Eng-->>Main: Engine { Host { runtime, user context } }
    Main->>Shell: ShellInit { backend: DesktopBackend, control: Engine }
    Shell->>Shell: first frame: theme, waker, sessions.list, restored route
  end
